[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3610393780","pull_request_review_id":4730605732,"id":3610393780,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7XMjy0","diff_hunk":"@@ -2522,7 +2528,9 @@ void Viewport::_gui_set_drag_preview(Control *p_base, Control *p_control) {\n \tERR_FAIL_COND(p_control->get_parent() != nullptr);\n \n \tControl *drag_preview = _gui_get_drag_preview();\n-\tmemdelete(drag_preview);\n+\tif (drag_preview && drag_preview->is_inside_tree()) {\n+\t\tmemdelete(drag_preview);","path":"scene/main/viewport.cpp","commit_id":"aae71faa89692ed860a57762c26c4555708710d6","original_commit_id":"aae71faa89692ed860a57762c26c4555708710d6","user":{"login":"rune-scape","id":55224592,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjI0NTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55224592?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape","html_url":"https://github.com/rune-scape","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rune-scape/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"won't this leak nodes if you repeatedly call `_gui_set_drag_preview`?\nin my opinion this `memdelete` and the one above should be replaced with a `set_visible(false)` and `queue_free()`\nlike:\n```cpp\nControl *drag_preview = _gui_get_drag_preview();\nif (drag_preview) {\n\tgui.drag_preview_id = ObjectID();\n\tdrag_preview->set_visible(false);\n\tdrag_preview->queue_free();\n}\n```\n\nthis seems to fix it in my tests","created_at":"2026-07-19T10:42:45Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T10:46:15Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120828#discussion_r3610393780","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120828","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3610393780"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120828#discussion_r3610393780"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120828"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3610393780/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":2532,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":38,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3610798013","pull_request_review_id":4730970210,"id":3610798013,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7XOGe9","diff_hunk":"@@ -2522,7 +2528,9 @@ void Viewport::_gui_set_drag_preview(Control *p_base, Control *p_control) {\n \tERR_FAIL_COND(p_control->get_parent() != nullptr);\n \n \tControl *drag_preview = _gui_get_drag_preview();\n-\tmemdelete(drag_preview);\n+\tif (drag_preview && drag_preview->is_inside_tree()) {\n+\t\tmemdelete(drag_preview);","path":"scene/main/viewport.cpp","commit_id":"aae71faa89692ed860a57762c26c4555708710d6","original_commit_id":"aae71faa89692ed860a57762c26c4555708710d6","user":{"login":"Thiago-Weiss","id":137117035,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCw9aw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137117035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss","html_url":"https://github.com/Thiago-Weiss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Yes, this does fix the bug, and it was actually the first approach I tried. However, when I ran the tests, they failed because using `queue_free()` instead of `memdelete` keeps the node in the scene tree for longer, while the tests expect it to be deleted immediately.\r\n[link to failing tests](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions/runs/28537109309/job/84601837194)\r\n\r\nAfter your comment today, I tested it again, and it still fails. However, you also made one additional change that I hadn't tried before: hiding the preview with `drag_preview->set_visible(false);`. That change made more of the tests pass, but it still failed.\r\n<img width=\"1256\" height=\"761\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ef5433f-d273-47f2-b7f4-5caf6d1d9ef2\" />\r\n\r\nSo, since the original behavior was to use `memdelete`, switching to `queue_free()` would change the deletion logic and still cause test failures. For that reason, I don't think it's worth replacing `memdelete` with `queue_free()` in this case.\r\n","created_at":"2026-07-19T15:06:56Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T15:06:56Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120828#discussion_r3610798013","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120828","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3610798013"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120828#discussion_r3610798013"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120828"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3610798013/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":2532,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3610393780,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":38,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]